thub.com/users/misaka-ning/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misaka-ning/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misaka-ning/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misaka-ning/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-xz","state":"uploaded","size":847507304,"digest":"sha256:bcf9e2dcfb27e96db3c411dfa71da3e7dc248ed81ed1adb0c554ee08ba7d29e6","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-20T10:38:38Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T10:40:48Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/misaka-ning/vision-studio/releases/download/v2.3.1/vision-studio-2.3.1-complete-source.tar.xz"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misaka-ning/vision-studio/releases/assets/659029108","id":659029108,"node_id":"RA_kwDOU_HWPM4nR_x0","name":"vision-studio_2.3.1-1_amd64.deb","label":"","uploader":{"login":"misaka-ning","id":205516136,"node_id":"U_kgDODD_taA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/205516136?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/misaka-ning","html_url":"https://github.com/misaka-ning","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misaka-ning/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misaka-ning/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misaka-ning/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misaka-ning/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misaka-ning/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misaka-ning/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misaka-ning/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misaka-ning/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misaka-ning/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-debian-package","state":"uploaded","size":387141452,"digest":"sha256:1e959057337832f2dac8d950d738426ad426ea124aee7cefc925286792d19758","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-20T10:37:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T10:38:36Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/misaka-ning/vision-studio/releases/download/v2.3.1/vision-studio_2.3.1-1_amd64.deb"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misaka-ning/vision-studio/tarball/v2.3.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misaka-ning/vision-studio/zipball/v2.3.1","body":"# Vision Studio 2.3.1\n\n本版修复 2.3.0 的数据集导入入口只能选择 YAML、无法直接选择文件夹的问题。继续使用 C++17／Qt 6.8.3、Fluent 深色界面和现有 CPU／NVIDIA GPU 后端，评估指标与推理逻辑沿用 2.3.0。\n\n## 直接选择数据集文件夹\n\n- 点击「YOLO 数据集」默认选择数据集根文件夹；同排箭头保留「选择 YAML 配置文件…」入口。\n- 只检查根目录，优先采用唯一的 `data.yaml`、`data.yml`、`dataset.yaml` 或 `dataset.yml`，大小写不敏感。没有约定名称时，可采用根目录唯一的 YAML。\n- 多个约定配置，或无约定名称且存在多个 YAML 时，明确提示选择配置文件；不扫描子目录、不猜测训练配置、不自动生成类别或改写 YAML。\n- 导入仍是只读预检查与 GT 预览，不自动开始整集推理。图片、标注和用户配置保持原样。\n\n## 错误后可以继续重试\n\n首次导入失败后保留待导入位置、集合与可选 metadata，并显示行内错误。可以切换 Train／Val／Test，再点击「重新检查」；数据集未提供 Val 时不会擅自切换到 Train。若已有有效数据集，新的导入失败会恢复原数据集、队列和结果。\n\nYAML 的 `path` 相对配置文件所在目录解析，集合路径相对 `path`。通过文件夹入口导入时，失效的绝对根目录可按所选目录只读迁移：仅映射旧根目录之内且原位置已不存在的集合／名单路径，严格检查成功后显示迁移提示；直接选择 YAML 仍严格使用原配置路径。原配置和数据保持原样，其他路径错误需核对配置。只有 images／labels 而没有标准配置时，应用不会猜测类别或集合。已有评估、三种检测范围、阈值分析、结果回看与配置采用继续保留。\n\n## 验证与文件\n\n本版已完成一次完整 18 套回归，实际 293 项 Qt 结果、101 项 Python 测试，零失败、零跳过；其中评估 Python 49 项、面板 22 项、工作台集成 27 项。最终 DEB、隔离安装／卸载、CPU／RTX 4060 CUDA、两种转换后推理和完整对应源码核验通过；公开 COCO8 的六个包内评估场景、三组同权重比较及文件夹迁移 10 项专项通过。用户目录的 1223 张 Val 只做只读预检查，没有据此宣称模型准确率。真实报告、原始日志和截图范围见[完整验收报告](https://github.com/misaka-ning/vision-studio/blob/v2.3.1/docs/releases/evidence/2.3.1/README.md)。额外 UI 四项不重复计数；1380×940 既有右摘要文字裁切已记录。Windows 2.3.1 与物理摄像头未测试；COCO8 小集合仅验证管线，不代表足球能力。此处验收结果不预先表示 GitHub 发布或宿主安装已经完成。\n\n正式标签为 `v2.3.1`，Debian 版本为 `2.3.1-1`，默认安装到 `/opt/VisionStudio`。Linux Release 保持三个手动附件：\n\n- `vision-studio_2.3.1-1_amd64.deb`\n- `vision-studio-2.3.1-complete-source.tar.xz`\n- `SHA256SUMS`\n\n```bash\nsha256sum -c SHA256SUMS\nsudo apt install ./vision-studio_2.3.1-1_amd64.deb\n```\n\n升级前结束检测、评估、录制和转换并退出旧程序。设置、模型、运行记录、导出、录像、评估报告与 GPU 环境保留；程序不向原数据集或安装目录写入评估结果。\n\n本版远端标签、发布状态、三个附件大小与 SHA256 核验成功后，按规范保留本地 2.3.1 与 2.3.0，并逐版检查旧发行／构建副本后清理。历史远端标签、Linux 核心附件与 2.1.0 Windows 补充包保持原样。\n\n应用代码采用 AGPL-3.0-only；第三方保持各自许可，完整对应源码与原始通知随包交付。本版无新增运行依赖。GitHub 自动 Source code ZIP／tar.gz 来自标签，不能替代完整对应源码包。\n"}